data: {"id": "f2fdf7b99307480f-final", "run_id": "f2fdf7b99307480f", "seq": 1578, "ts_ms": 1788477369818, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-11/workload` | Terminating | Pod aiops-case-11/workload Terminating Stuck |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | pod.status (fact-12715ce3ec30) | status: Terminating (lasts 44m) | 明确异常现象：Pod 在 44 分钟前进入 Terminating 状态且未退出 |\n| 2 | K8s State | pod.phase (fact-d4b75d4f775d) | phase: Running | 辅助确认：Pod 底层资源仍未被 K8s 回收，处于僵持状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | event.message (fact-1267b19dbec2) | message: Normal Killing kubelet Stopping container app | 证明 kubelet 已执行停止容器的动作，Kubelet 侧无故障 |\n| 4 | K8s State | container.last_exit_code (fact-75c7161cab69) | exit_code: 137 | 证明容器是因系统强制终止 (OOMKill/Shutdown) 而退出，并非健康存活 |\n| 5 | K8s Event | event.message (fact-7cc5ded708a2) | message: Exit Code: 137 | 交叉验证容器退出原因，确认异常终止信号 |\n| 6 | Metric | container restarts (fact-7a7908222167) | value: 0 | 排除重启风暴或循环拉起，说明该 Pod 自启动后未成功恢复过 |\n\n**证据关联说明**：\n- **机制确认**：事实 #3 与 #4 证实容器因收到终止信号（Exit 137）已停止运行，但事实 #1 显示 Pod 状态卡在 `Terminating`。\n- **排除干扰**：事实 #5 确认了退出码的真实性；事实 #6 表明这不是一个反复重启的问题，排除了应用崩溃导致 Pod 状态不稳定的其他可能。\n- **现象锁定**：Kubelet 完成了删除操作，但 Pod 对象未被删除，且无日志或追踪数据支持外部控制器未响应，仅能从状态机卡点推断。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用容器异常终止 (Exit 137) → 触发 Pod 删除流程 → Custom finalizer 'aiops.lab/hold' 未被清理 → Pod 对象无法从 API Server 移除\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod 状态卡死是由自定义 Finalizer `aiops.lab/hold` 未能被移除导致的。\n**依据**：\n- Pod 处于 `Terminating` 状态超过 44 分钟 (证据 #1)，说明垃圾回收（Garbage Collection）流程被阻断。\n- 容器已非正常运行状态（Exit 137, 证据 #3, #4），且 Pod 本身无健康度问题（证据 #2）。\n- 结合正式 RCA，在 Kubelet 已成功停止容器的前提下，Pod 对象删除阻塞的直接原因是 Finalizer 未清除。\n\n**当前证据局限**：\n现有事实仅展示了“被 Finalizer 阻塞”这一**结果现象**。由于 Logging 和 Tracing 维度为空，且无证据显示 Finalizer 控制器或 Webhook 的状态，当前数据无法证明该 Finalizer 是“正常等待业务逻辑完成”还是“控制器/Webhook 故障导致清理失败”。因此，根因确认为“Finalizer 阻塞”，但阻塞的**深层系统原因（如控制器 Bug 或超时）**在当前证据下**证据不足**。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 41.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-11/workload: 41.6s (Evidence 34.6s, RCA 6.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- 未调用 Runbook\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 70.605, "metrics": {"run_id": "f2fdf7b99307480f", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 70.610032081604, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "38%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": false, "runbook_id": null, "pass": false, "score": 0.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.045, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "未匹配"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 70610.032081604, "llm_calls": 9, "llm_duration_ms": 65493.98684501648, "tool_calls": 9, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 9, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 13951.570272445679, "too